t.relationship</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Contract.term.asset.relationship</td><td>Element `Contract.term.asset.relationship` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.term.asset.relationship` as `Equivalent`.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.term.asset.context</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">context</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.term.asset.context</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Contract.term.asset.context</td><td>Element `Contract.term.asset.context` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.term.asset.context` as `Equivalent`.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.term.asset.context.reference</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">reference</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.term.asset.context.reference</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Contract.term.asset.context.reference</td><td>Element `Contract.term.asset.context.reference` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.term.asset.context.reference` as `Equivalent`.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.term.asset.context.code</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">code</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.term.asset.context.code</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Contract.term.asset.context.code</td><td>Element `Contract.term.asset.context.code` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.term.asset.context.code` as `Equivalent`.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.term.asset.context.text</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">text</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\"