er-left-width: 0px\">reasonLinkId</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.term.action.reasonLinkId</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Contract.term.action.reasonLinkId</td><td>Element `Contract.term.action.reasonLinkId` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.term.action.reasonLinkId` as `Equivalent`.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.term.action.note</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">note</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.term.action.note</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Contract.term.action.note</td><td>Element `Contract.term.action.note` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.term.action.note` as `Equivalent`.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.term.action.securityLabelNumber</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">securityLabelNumber</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.term.action.securityLabelNumber</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Contract.term.action.securityLabelNumber</td><td>Element `Contract.term.action.securityLabelNumber` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.term.action.securityLabelNumber` as `Equivalent`.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.term.group</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">group</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.term.group</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Contract.term.group</td><td>Element `Contract.term.group` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.term.group` as `Equivalent`.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.supportingInfo</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">supportingInfo</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.supportingInfo</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Contract.supportingInfo</td><td>Element `Contract.supportingInfo` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.supportingInfo` as `Equivalent`.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.relevantHistory</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">relevantHistory</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.relevantHistory</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Contract.relevantHistory</td><td>Element `Contract.relevantHistory` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.relevantHistory` as `Equivalent`.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.signer</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">signer</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.signer</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Contract.signer</td><td>Element `Contract.signer` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.signer` as `Equivalent`.\nSigners who are principal parties to the contract are bound by the Contract.activity related to the Contract.topic, and the Contract.term(s), which either extend or restrict the overall action on the topic by, for example, stipulating specific policies or obligations constraining actions, action reason, or agents with respect to some or all of the topic.#xD;For example, specifying how policies or obligations shall constrain actions and action reasons permitted or denied on all or a subset of the Contract.topic (e.g., all or a portion of property being transferred by the contract), agents (e.g., who can resell, assign interests, or alter the property being transferred by the contract), actions, and action reasons; or with respect to Contract.terms, stipulating, extending, or limiting the Contract.period of applicability or valuation of items under consideration.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.signer.type</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">type</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.signer.type</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Contract.signer.type</td><td>Element `Contract.signer.type` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.signer.type` as `Equivalent`.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.signer.party</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">party</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.signer.party</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Contract.signer.party</td><td>Element `Contract.signer.party` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.signer.party` as `Equivalent`.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.signer.signature</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">signature</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.signer.signature</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Contract.signer.signature</td><td>Element `Contract.signer.signature` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.signer.signature` as `Equivalent`.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.friendly</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">friendly</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.friendly</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Contract.friendly</td><td>Element `Contract.friendly` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.friendly` as `Equivalent`.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.friendly.content[x]</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">content[x]</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.friendly.content[x]</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Contract.friendly.content[x]</td><td>Element `Contract.friendly.content[x]` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.friendly.content[x]` as `SourceIsBroaderThanTarget`.\nThe standard extension `alternate-reference` has been mapped as the representation of FHIR R5 element `Contract.friendly.content[x]` with unmapped reference targets: DocumentReference.\nSource element `Contract.friendly.content[x]` has unmapped reference types. While the target element `Contract.friendly.content[x]` is a choice type and does not allow extensions, the `alternate-reference` extension can be applied to Reference values within it.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.legal</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">legal</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.legal</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Contract.legal</td><td>Element `Contract.legal` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.legal` as `Equivalent`.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.legal.content[x]</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">content[x]</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.legal.content[x]</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Contract.legal.content[x]</td><td>Element `Contract.legal.content[x]` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.legal.content[x]` as `SourceIsBroaderThanTarget`.\nThe standard extension `alternate-reference` has been mapped as the representation of FHIR R5 element `Contract.legal.content[x]` with unmapped reference targets: DocumentReference.\nSource element `Contract.legal.content[x]` has unmapped reference types. While the target element `Contract.legal.content[x]` is a choice type and does not allow extensions, the `alternate-reference` extension can be applied to Reference values within it.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.rule</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">rule</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.rule</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Contract.rule</td><td>Element `Contract.rule` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.rule` as `Equivalent`.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.rule.content[x]</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">content[x]</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.rule.content[x]</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Contract.rule.content[x]</td><td>Element `Contract.rule.content[x]` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.rule.content[x]` as `SourceIsBroaderThanTarget`.\nThe mappings for `Contract.rule.content[x]` do not cover the following types based on type expansion: display, identifier, reference, type.\nThe standard extension `alternate-reference` has been mapped as the representation of FHIR R5 element `Contract.rule.content[x]` with unmapped reference targets: DocumentReference.\nSource element `Contract.rule.content[x]` has unmapped reference types. While the target element `Contract.rule.content[x]` is a choice type and does not allow extensions, the `alternate-reference` extension can be applied to Reference values within it.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.legallyBinding[x]</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">legallyBinding[x]</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Contract.legallyBinding[x]</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Contract.legallyBinding[x]</td><td>Element `Contract.legallyBinding[x]` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.legallyBinding[x]` as `SourceIsBroaderThanTarget`.\nThe standard extension `alternate-reference` has been mapped as the representation of FHIR R5 element `Contract.legallyBinding[x]` with unmapped reference targets: DocumentReference.\nSource element `Contract.legallyBinding[x]` has unmapped reference types. While the target element `Contract.legallyBinding[x]` is a choice type and does not allow extensions, the `alternate-reference` extension can be applied to Reference values within it.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <code>http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Contract|5.0.0</code> to <a href=\"index.html\">Extensions for Using Data Elements from FHIR R5 in FHIR R4</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>Contract.term.action.reason (reason)</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>http://hl7.org/fhir/5.0/StructureDefinition/extension-Contract.term.action.reason</td><td>Element `Contract.term.action.reason` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.term.action.reasonCode` as `SourceIsBroaderThanTarget`.\nElement `Contract.term.action.reason` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.term.action.reasonReference` as `SourceIsBroaderThanTarget`.\nElement `Contract.term.action.reason` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Contract.term.action.reason` as `SourceIsBroaderThanTarget`.\nThe mappings for `Contract.term.action.reason` do not cover the following types: CodeableReference.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 3 </b>Mapping from <code>http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Contract|5.0.0</code> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/extensions/5.2.0/index.html\">FHIR Extensions Packversion: 5.2.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>Contract.friendly.content[x] (content[x])</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/alternate-reference</td><td>R5: additional references</td></tr><tr><td>Contract.legal.content[x] (content[x])</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/alternate-reference</td><td>R5: additional references</td></tr><tr><td>Contract.rule.content[x] (content[x])</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/alternate-reference</td><td>R5: additional references</td></tr><tr><td>Contract.legallyBinding[x] (legallyBinding[x])</td><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/alternate-reference</td><td>R5: additional references</td></tr></table></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
  ] ; # 
